# Vitest rewrites snapshot files with LF on every run, regardless of the
# checkout's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, that rewrite makes the
# working tree look dirty after every test run even though the content is
# byte-identical as text. Scoped to snapshots only — do not widen this to
# `* text=auto` or any other pattern; that would renormalize the whole repo
# in one commit and conflict with every branch in flight (see #217).
*.snap text eol=lf
